  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building and Marketing Support for the Promotion of Panamanian Handicrafts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROARTESANA will improve the skills, earnings, self-esteem, cultural pride and market participation of about 300 craftspeople, mostly women, from Panama City, the central provinces, indigenous reserves and other areas. The grantee will provide training and technical assistance to develop techniques and marketing skills so the craftspeople can tap into tourist and other high- end sales outlets, including via the Internet. (PN-290)</narrative>
  </description>
